      "summary_short": {
        "zh": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B是在Qwen3-4B基座上微调得到的文本嵌入模型，专为语义检索、RAG和向量搜索设计，能以更丰富的语义表达处理长文本。其技术亮点是采用解码器架构，同时支持词元级与句子级嵌入，无需额外编码器即可获得高质量向量。接入方式很简便：既可用Sentence-Transformers加载，也可用Text-Embeddings-Inference部署。你可以用它把知识库文档切成片段并向量化，再借助余弦相似度实现精准召回，满足搜索、聚类、分类等实际需求。",
        "en": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B turns the Qwen3-4B base model into a high-performance text-embedding engine, solving retrieval, RAG, and semantic-search problems with richer context understanding. Its key design insight is unifying token and sentence-level embeddings via a decoder-only archi…",
        "es": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B turns the Qwen3-4B base model into a high-performance text-embedding engine, solving retrieval, RAG, and semantic-search problems with richer context understanding. Its key design insight is unifying token and sentence-level embeddings via a decoder-only archi…"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "zh": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B是在Qwen3-4B基座上微调得到的文本嵌入模型，专为语义检索、RAG和向量搜索设计，能以更丰富的语义表达处理长文本。其技术亮点是采用解码器架构，同时支持词元级与句子级嵌入，无需额外编码器即可获得高质量向量。接入方式很简便：既可用Sentence-Transformers加载，也可用Text-Embeddings-Inference部署。你可以用它把知识库文档切成片段并向量化，再借助余弦相似度实现精准召回，满足搜索、聚类、分类等实际需求。",
        "en": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B turns the Qwen3-4B base model into a high-performance text-embedding engine, solving retrieval, RAG, and semantic-search problems with richer context understanding. Its key design insight is unifying token and sentence-level embeddings via a decoder-only architecture, enabling flexible embeddings without a separate encoder. You can load it through Sentence-Transformers or deploy with Text-Embeddings-Inference, then use it to embed long documents or queries and compare them for search, clustering, or classification tasks.",
        "es": "Qwen3-Embedding-4B turns the Qwen3-4B base model into a high-performance text-embedding engine, solving retrieval, RAG, and semantic-search problems with richer context understanding. Its key design insight is unifying token and sentence-level embeddings via a decoder-only architecture, enabling flexible embeddings without a separate encoder. You can load it through Sentence-Transformers or deploy with Text-Embeddings-Inference, then use it to embed long documents or queries and compare them for search, clustering, or classification tasks."
      },
